the-history-of-the-work-5 : List Word
the-history-of-the-work-5 = unlines (cons "What follows from Avik's corrections for the history explorer (2026-11-15). An object is its content, so nothing is overwritten and the history is" (cons "already present: in the store, its log of names bound to keys over time; while git is the stand-in," (cons "git itself. A history explorer adds no structure and keeps nothing. It reads what is there when" (cons "asked, and reports only what the work declares: its nodes (type Node, and Ticket before it), the" (cons "leaves in progress and resolved, and the documents its code points to. Folders, file types and" (cons "sessions organize nothing. Its views are code of the language, evaluated by the machine over the work's" (cons "own values, as the task graph's views are." nil)))))))
